OL,3,GNEWSA'No-one believed me,' Katie Price
OL,4,Atells ex's trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FKatie Price has told a jury no-one
OL,7,Fbelieved her when she said her
OL,8,Fex-husband had acted inappropriately
OL,9,Fwith a teenager.
OL,11,FKieran Hayler is accused of three
OL,12,Fcounts of rape and one count of sexual
OL,13,Fassault of a then 13-year-old girl in
OL,14,FWest Sussex in 2016.
OL,16,FHayler, 39, who was married to the
OL,17,Freality TV star at the time of the
OL,18,Falleged offences, denies the charges
OL,19,Fagainst him.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
